'''Dusk''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Blacksmith (Zone)}} within the {{Zone|Mining District}} on the [[Hub Island]]. They are found in a room next to the {{MobSprite|Smithmonger}}. Next to them is the [[Runic Pedestal]], which is used for {{Skill|Runecrafting}}.

